      "demo_description": "",
      "description": "Proxim8 is an illustrative 24-hour distributed-inference site in an existing Campbell, California office building sharing a PG&E service with t=0 at local midnight on a business weekday, capped at 5.0 MW. It has 10 Slurm training jobs, 1,000 Kubernetes inference sessions serving Mistral and Cohere LLMs, and 10,000 short Ray agentic API calls; all use hopper_8gpu_air. The seeded workload generator uses seed 20261102. DR-2026-11-02-PROXIM8-MIDNIGHT (PROPOSED_HERE): 5 overnight Kubernetes sessions start at midnight as 24/7 inference carry-over from the previous day. Physical sizing, workload timing, BESS sizing, office PUE, building curve and diesel placeholder are PROPOSED_HERE, illustrative assumptions rather than measured Proxim8 data. DR-2026-11-02-PROXIM8-COOLING (PROPOSED_HERE): non_gpu_load_profile_mw is building non-HVAC electricity (lighting, elevators and tenant plug loads); the existing engine cooling envelope adds modelled HVAC on top without changing alpha_max or other cooling parameters. The curve is scaled using the actual steady-state relation input + alpha_max \u00d7 lagged input, so at alpha_max=0.2 its input is target/(1+alpha_max): about 0.7 MW total overnight, ramping 6:00\u20139:00, about 1.6 MW 13:00\u201317:00, and 0.8 MW by 21:00. A 1.0 MW / 2.0 MWh grid-forming BESS starts at 95% SoC and can recharge from grid headroom; no SoC-floor workaround is needed. No turbines, solar or fuel cells are configured; the diesel block is disabled. The built-in PG&E Schedule B-20 TOU rates are selected with the July calendar month; 114.82 USD/MWh is the flat operating-cost fallback. Queue-stress variant. The former 16:35 Ray burst is rescheduled as one concentrated early chain wave and nine seeded afternoon call-chain waves. Starts are sampled from the source K8S inference arrival-time curve across 09:00\u201318:00, with a morning anchor, at least twenty minutes between starts, and a six-hour minimum span. Uniform 60\u2013420 second target durations are recorded independently; the test reports measured cap-held durations from telemetry. All moved calls retain their IDs, durations, node counts, profiles and model names. Seed 20261102; 7,200 moved jobs. DR-2026-11-03-PROXIM8-QUEUE (PROPOSED_HERE).",
